WEBVTT

00:06:59.321 --> 00:07:00.411
Same as she did, OK.

00:07:00.435 --> 00:07:02.063
You've got a seven-digit number --

00:07:02.087 --> 00:07:04.097
call out any six of them loud and clear.

00:07:04.544 --> 00:07:08.236
Volunteer: 0, 7, 9, 0, 4, 4.

00:07:08.260 --> 00:07:09.976
I think you left out the number 3?

00:07:10.834 --> 00:07:11.941
AB: That's three.

00:07:11.965 --> 00:07:15.127
The odds of me getting
all four of these right by random guessing

00:07:15.151 --> 00:07:17.650
would be one in 10,000:
10 to the fourth power.

00:07:17.674 --> 00:07:19.239
OK, any six of them.

00:07:19.263 --> 00:07:20.317
(Laughter)

00:07:20.341 --> 00:07:22.396
Really scramble them up this time, please.

00:07:22.634 --> 00:07:25.976
Volunteer: 2, 6, 3, 9, 7, 2.

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:27.794
Did you leave out the number 7?

00:07:27.818 --> 00:07:31.038
And let's give all four of these people
a nice round of applause.